## Why This Is Asked
This question probes practical understanding of online ICA workflow for mobile, real-time audio with nonstationary noise.

## Key Concepts
- Online whitening and demixing; frame-wise updating; permutation alignment.
- Handling nonstationarity; simple energy/phase cues for gating frames.

## Code Example
```javascript
// Example: simple whitening placeholder (not a full ICA)
function whiten(X) {
  // X: [frames, channels]
  const M = covariance(X);
  const {eigvec, eigval} = eigenDecomp(M);
  return X.dot(eigvec).div(sqrt(eigval));
}
```

